/P 77 0 R
/E (You think you're playing against "the casino" But the casino isn't really playing against you. The casino simply set up the rules so that statistically, over time, they always win. The house edge. The math. The game is designed for them to profit, not because they're cheating, but because the structure favors them.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
