132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (Big players see that there are thousands of stop losses sitting below 5190. Thousands of sell orders waiting to be triggered. That's their liquidity. That's their entry.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
